    superPowersDesc: 'SuperPowers turn a staking badge go for you use like money. Every two weeks, your badge give you extra power, and when you use one, it put your post at top of home feed. Team up open for everybody, and combine wallet power of up to eight accounts. So, every member get the badge for all their total power. The slot go rotate: when many boosts running, viewers get one by how strong your badge is. So, strong badge show more often, but everybody still get their chance.',
    superPowersDescV2: 'SuperPowers turn a staking badge go for you use like money. Every two weeks, your badge give you extra power, and when you use one, it put your post at top of home feed. Team up open for everybody, and combine wallet power of up to eight accounts. So, every member get the badge for all their total power. The slot go rotate: when many boosts running, viewers get one by how strong your badge is. So, strong badge show more often, but everybody still get their chance.',
    boostPower: '1) Boost',
    secondWindPower: '2) Second Wind',
    trendJacker: '4) Trend Jacker',
    timelineBomber: '5) Timeline Bomber',
    precisionStrike: '8) Precision Strike',
    harpoon: '9) Harpoon',
    superPowersMore2: 'Twa beli power a live na listet wey app a show. Comment Anchor de hold wey you comment fit stay at top of somebody else’s thread. Signal Flare send one notification go every account wey follow you. Flak Jacket make post a immune go downvote burial while wey it run. Team up fit let as many as eight account combine wallet power wey you, so every member wear badge wey pooled balance a unlock. Front Row put Stage wey you host at top of stages rail. Deep Current give one boost wey you go somebody else’s post.',
    superPowersMoreV2: 'Twa beli power a live na listet wey app a show. Comment Anchor de hold wey you comment fit stay at top of somebody else’s thread. Signal Flare send one notification go every account wey follow you. Flak Jacket make post a immune go downvote burial while wey it run. Team up fit let as many as eight account combine wallet power wey you, so every member wear badge wey pooled balance a unlock. Front Row put Stage wey you host at top of stages rail. Deep Current give one boost wey you go somebody else’s post.',
    superPowersLink: 'Waka yu a money wey yu get a month, na full ladder wey yu go climb a life yu.',
    spPowersLead: 'Efere na badge ladder, each step open one power, an all power you unlock stay open. Dem all use same fortnight allowance, so choice be what you spend it for.',
