    feeTierSubtitle: 'Badge-Based Fee Reduction',
    feeTierDesc: 'Wetin we dey do for deHub token holder, na for dem go get big discount for platform fee. Start from 10% standard fee, but for every badge level dem earn for more token dey hold, fee go reduce by 0.69%. For Megalodon badge holder, fee go drop to just 1% - dat na 99% discount for dem who dey stay faithful to community.',
