    fiatOnRampItem4: 'Won wey wey you go, you must follow local payment rules, no cut corner, no fake, no lie. If you no dey follow, you go get big trouble, maybe even go jail. So, wey you dey, make sure you pay tax, use right bank, and no do anything illegal. If you no sure, ask someone wey know, no go guess guess.',
    fiatOnRampNote: 'Mi a go comply wey all law wey fit wey digital asset fit buy, wey fit wey mi a stay, na dem a go follow.',
    burnMintText: 'DeHub no dey keep right wey we go use burn & mint fi protect holder wey dey attack, hack, exploit, mistake wey user dey do, or exchange go break down. Mechanism dis go serve as security measure fi protect community, keep token ecosystem dey strong even when situation dey go be extra-ordinary.',
    permissionsText: 'You can use dis Service like dey give to you, but you must follow dis Agreement and any law dat dey say.',
