    monetizationOwnership: 'E go keep full ownship wey you dey fit your content, an wey you go fit make money from dem through different way like tip, subscription, NFT sell, an other blockchain money-make way.',
    decentralizedModerationText: 'Content moderation wey dey on DeHub, dem handle for community governance system wey dey.',
    decentralizedModerationItem2: 'Voting system wey go happen on blockchain, na for dem moderation policy decision, go be transparent like dat.',
    decentralizedModerationItem4: 'Poli na governance dey set, no single person dey set. Enforcement na moderator wey dey choose, dem dey act fast wey.',
    designatedModeratorsText: 'Community-choose amosun a top-rank badge holder, dem get delegate moderation power. Dem can remove content, suspend or kick out abusive account fast, no need wait for governance vote, when content illegal, break community rule, or pose danger to user.',
    designatedModeratorsItem1: 'Moderator wey naa name go dey, dem go remove any post, comment, stream, or media wey naa picture/voice naa, straight away.',
    designatedModeratorsItem2: '"Moderator wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey wey na wey',
    designatedModeratorsItem3: 'Report wey user send in, go dey pass to moderator wey assign for check for dem.',
    designatedModeratorsItem4: 'Governans dey set de policy dat moderators dey enforce, an dem can review or reverse dem decisions, but enforcement dey happen straight away.',
    contentRestrictionsItem2: 'Content wey go break a rule a community, like wey moderator a dem go enforce.',
    contentRestrictionsItem3: 'Spam teknikal or aktiwiditi malisio wey go dey make platform no safe',
    rightsYouGrantText: 'Mi keep all right fi my content. Anyting fi mi, mi keep fi mi.',
    licenseToDeHubText: 'By you give content to dis Service, you give DeHub one worldwide, no-exclusive, no-pay license to host and share your content through dis decentralized platform for dey operate dis Service.',
    licenseToOthersText: 'You grant other users of dis Service de right to come in and see your content like how di platform dey allow, but you still keep all di money-making and ownership right for yourself.',
    accountManagement: 'Account Management',
